{%- comment -%} SHOKOGI home — rest: testimonials, foil (text then video), shop, rentals, journal, closer. Vars: foil_video, rentals_image. {%- endcomment -%}

<!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
<div class="sec tint"><div class="wrap">
  <div data-r><div class="eyebrow-wrap"><span class="kicker">testimonials</span></div>
  <h2>Why Surfers Love Shokogi</h2></div>
  <div class="revs" data-rs>
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>This is without a doubt the best surf shop ever - the location itself is just AMAZING - but the staff who work there are even more amazing.</p><div class="who">Charles <span>&middot; Canada</span></div></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>Our 4.5 years old participated in Shokogi&rsquo;s surf camp during Christmas break. Within 4-5 days he was SURFING!</p><div class="who">Noa <span>&middot; USA</span></div></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>Had an amazing experience at Shokogi! The surf lessons were excellent&mdash;great instructors who really know their stuff when it comes to surfing and bring so much heart and energy to every lesson.</p><div class="who">Eden <span>&middot; Israel</span></div></div>
    <div class="rev"><div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div><p>Where friends become family. It was my first time surfing, and I loved every second of it, yes even the crashing. The team welcomes you with open arms. For me it felt like coming home!</p><div class="who">Eline <span>&middot; Belgium</span></div></div>
  </div>
</div></div>

<!-- FOIL (text, then full-width video — as the original) -->
<div class="sec"><div class="wrap" data-r>
  <div class="eyebrow-wrap"><span class="kicker">Glide Above the Waves</span></div>
  <h2>Foil Surf Lessons in Playa Venao</h2>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:24px">Learn to foil surf with expert instructors in perfect conditions. Safe, fun, and beginner-friendly.</p>
  <div style="text-align:center"><a href="/collections/foil-surfing" class="btn pink">Fly Now</a></div>
</div></div>
<div class="videofull">
  <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"{% if foil_video != blank and foil_video.preview_image %} poster="{{ foil_video.preview_image | image_url: width: 1600 }}"{% endif %}>
    {%- if foil_video != blank and foil_video.sources.size > 0 -%}
      {%- for src in foil_video.sources -%}{%- if src.format == 'mp4' -%}<source src="{{ src.url }}" type="video/mp4">{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
    {%- else -%}
      <source src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/vp/edff47b97c4446f880778bb32dd26bca/edff47b97c4446f880778bb32dd26bca.HD-720p-4.5Mbps-48918163.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    {%- endif -%}
  </video>
  <div class="skwave" aria-hidden="true"><i class="w1"></i><i class="w2"></i></div>
</div>

<!-- SHOP BRAND -->
<div class="sec"><div class="wrap">
  <div data-r><div class="eyebrow-wrap"><span class="kicker">shop</span></div>
  <h2>Gear Up with Shokogi</h2>
  <p class="lead">Represent Shokogi from all around the world and share the surf culture with family and friends. From stylish apparel to must-have surf gear &mdash; whether you need sun protection or new surf apparel, we&rsquo;ve got the essentials for every surfer.</p></div>
  <div class="pgrid" data-rs>
    {%- assign brandcol = collections['shokogi-brand'] -%}
    {%- for product in brandcol.products limit: 8 -%}
    <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="pcard">
      {%- if product.featured_image -%}{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '300,450,600', alt: product.title }}{%- endif -%}
      <div class="pcard-b">
        <h3>{{ product.title }}</h3>
        <div class="pprice">{{ product.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</div>
        <span class="pbtn">View</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px" data-r><a href="/collections/shokogi-brand" class="btn pink">Shop Now</a></div>
</div></div>

<!-- RENTALS -->
<div class="sec tint"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="band rev" data-r>
    {%- if rentals_image -%}<img src="{{ rentals_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}" alt="Surf Board Rentals in Playa Venao" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
    <div class="bt">
      <div class="kicker">rentals</div>
      <h2>Surf Board Rentals in Playa Venao</h2>
      <p>Traveling light or trying something new? Shokogi offers high-quality surfboard rentals, including shortboards, longboards, and our beginner-friendly Ocean Monkey soft-top boards. Grab a board, hit the waves, and experience Panama surf at your own pace.</p>
      <a href="/collections/surfboard-rental-panama" class="btn pink">Rent Today</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div>

<!-- JOURNAL -->
<div class="sec"><div class="wrap">
  <div data-r><div class="eyebrow-wrap"><span class="kicker">surf journal</span></div>
  <h2>Latest Articles</h2></div>
  <div class="bgrid" style="margin-top:26px" data-rs>
    {%- assign blog = blogs['surf-blog'] -%}
    {%- for article in blog.articles limit: 4 -%}
    <a href="{{ article.url }}" class="icard">
      {%- if article.image -%}{{ article.image | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '300,500,700', alt: article.title }}{%- endif -%}
      <div class="ib"><div class="k">{{ article.published_at | date: '%b %d, %Y' }}</div><h3>{{ article.title }}</h3></div>
    </a>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px" data-r><a href="/blogs/surf-blog" class="btn pink">Read the Blog</a></div>
</div></div>

<!-- CLOSER (a touch of black) -->
<section class="sk2-closer" data-r>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="kicker">join the family</span>
    <h2>Come surf with us in Playa Venao</h2>
    <p>Lessons, camps, foil, and rentals &mdash; all steps from the waves. Join the Shokogi surf family.</p>
    <a href="/collections/surf-school-and-courses" class="btn pink">Book Now</a>
  </div>
</section>
